---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const wa='https://wa.me/34623164848?text=Hola%20Kal%C3%A9ndula%2C%20quiero%20hacer%20un%20encargo.';
const cards=[['Ramos','Para regalar o regalarte. Frescos, preservados y siempre diferentes.','gallery-3.webp'],['Bodas','Una dirección floral completa para que todo hable el mismo idioma.','ai-wedding.webp'],['Celebraciones','Cumpleaños, comuniones y eventos que piden algo especial.','gallery-6.webp']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Kaléndula — Tu floristería diferente en Corrales" description="Ramos, bodas y celebraciones diseñadas desde nuestro atelier floral en Corrales, Huelva.">
<div class="v2" id="inicio"><header><a class="v2-logo" href="#inicio">kaléndula<span>✺</span></a><nav><a href="#ramos">Ramos</a><a href="#bodas">Bodas</a><a href="#atelier">Atelier</a></nav><a class="v2-order" href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Hacer un encargo ↗</a><button aria-label="Abrir navegación" aria-expanded="false">Menú</button></header>
<main>
<section class="v2-hero"><div class="v2-photo"><img src={`${base}images/ai-bouquet.webp`} alt="Gran ramo de flores de jardín" width="1536" height="2048" fetchpriority="high"><span>Flores de temporada · hechas en Corrales</span></div><div class="v2-copy"><p>Atelier floral / Huelva</p><h1>Flores para<br>decirlo <i>todo.</i></h1><div><p>Ramos con personalidad, bodas que se sienten vuestras y celebraciones llenas de color.</p><a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Quiero flores <b>↗</b></a></div></div></section>
<section class="v2-marquee" aria-label="Servicios"><div>RAMOS ✺ BODAS ✺ EVENTOS ✺ DECORACIÓN ✺ RAMOS ✺ BODAS ✺ EVENTOS ✺</div></section>
<section class="v2-intro" id="atelier"><aside><span>Desde Corrales</span><strong>Con cariño<br>y buen ojo.</strong></aside><div><p>No creemos en los ramos de catálogo.</p><h2>Elegimos cada flor por su forma, su color y el momento en el que está.</h2><p>Así hacemos piezas vivas, naturales y un poco inesperadas. Ven con una idea o déjate aconsejar.</p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kal%C3%A9ndula+Calle+San+Andr%C3%A9s+21120+Corrales+Huelva" target="_blank">Visitar el atelier ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="v2-cards" id="ramos">{cards.map(([title,text,img],i)=><article id={i===1?'bodas':undefined}><div><span>0{i+1}</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{text}</p><a href={wa}>Ver posibilidades ↗</a></div><img src={`${base}images/${img}`} alt={title} loading="lazy"></article>)}</section>
<section class="v2-banner"><div><p>¿Tienes fecha?</p><h2>Nosotras ponemos<br><i>las flores.</i></h2><a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Pedir presupuesto ↗</a></div><img src={`${base}images/ai-workshop.webp`} alt="Trabajo con flores en el atelier" loading="lazy"></section>
<section class="v2-social"><p>El día a día está en</p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kalendulatelier/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@kalendulatelier ↗</a><div>{['gallery-2.webp','gallery-7.webp','gallery-5.webp','gallery-8.webp'].map((img,i)=><img src={`${base}images/${img}`} alt={`Trabajo floral ${i+1}`} loading="lazy">)}</div></section>
<section class="v2-contact" id="contacto"><span>Una idea, una fecha, un “no sé muy bien qué quiero”.</span><h2>Cuéntanoslo.</h2><div><a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp · 623 164 848 ↗</a><address>C. San Andrés · Corrales, Huelva</address></div></section>
</main><footer><a class="v2-logo" href="#inicio">kaléndula<span>✺</span></a><p>Atelier floral · Corrales</p><nav><a href={`${base}aviso-legal/`}>Legal</a><a href={`${base}privacidad/`}>Privacidad</a><a href={`${base}cookies/`}>Cookies</a></nav></footer><a class="v2-fab" href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Pedir flores <span>↗</span></a></div>
<script is:inline>const b=document.querySelector('.v2 header button'),n=document.querySelector('.v2 header nav');b?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!o));n?.classList.toggle('open',!o)});</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
:global(body){margin:0;background:#fff7e9;color:#20372e;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}.v2{--green:#174a37;--orange:#f36f4b;--yellow:#f5df56;--pink:#f7b7bd;--cream:#fff7e9;overflow:hidden}.v2 header{position:absolute;z-index:10;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;width:100%;padding:1.1rem 2vw;color:#fff}.v2-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font:2rem/.8 'Italiana',serif}.v2-logo span{color:var(--yellow)}.v2 header nav{display:flex;gap:2rem;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-order{justify-self:end;padding:.9rem 1.2rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--green);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.v2 header button{display:none}
.v2-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55% 45%;min-height:100svh;background:var(--orange);color:#fff}.v2-photo{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:0 0 160px 0}.v2-photo img{height:100%;object-fit:cover}.v2-photo span{position:absolute;bottom:2rem;left:2rem;padding:.6rem 1rem;border-radius:99px;background:#ffffffd9;color:var(--green);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-copy{display:flex;padding:8rem 4vw 4rem;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.v2-copy>p{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em}.v2-copy h1{margin:auto 0;font:clamp(4.4rem,8vw,8.5rem)/.82 'Italiana',serif;letter-spacing:-.05em}.v2-copy h1 i{color:var(--yellow);font-weight:400}.v2-copy>div>p{max-width:28rem;font-size:1.05rem}.v2-copy>div>a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:min(100%,310px);margin-top:2rem;padding:1rem;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:99px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-copy>div>a:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--orange)}
.v2-marquee{padding:1rem 0;overflow:hidden;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--green);font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap;transform:rotate(-1deg);scale:1.02}.v2-marquee div{font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.13em;animation:slide 18s linear infinite}@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-40%)}}
.v2-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.55fr 1fr;gap:10vw;padding:10rem 6vw;background:var(--cream)}.v2-intro aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.v2-intro aside span{font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-intro aside strong{margin-top:auto;font:2.4rem/1 'Italiana',serif;color:var(--orange)}.v2-intro>div>p:first-child{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em}.v2-intro h2{max-width:900px;margin:2rem 0;font:clamp(3.4rem,6vw,6.3rem)/.95 'Italiana',serif}.v2-intro>div>p:not(:first-child){max-width:38rem}.v2-intro a,.v2-cards a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--orange);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}
.v2-cards{padding:0 2vw 8rem}.v2-cards article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 60%;min-height:680px;margin-bottom:1rem;overflow:hidden;border-radius:70px}.v2-cards article:nth-child(1){background:var(--pink)}.v2-cards article:nth-child(2){background:var(--green);color:#fff}.v2-cards article:nth-child(3){background:var(--yellow)}.v2-cards article:nth-child(even){grid-template-columns:60% 40%}.v2-cards article:nth-child(even) img{order:-1}.v2-cards article>div{display:flex;padding:4rem;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.v2-cards article span{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700}.v2-cards h2{margin:1.4rem 0;font:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem)/.85 'Italiana',serif}.v2-cards p{max-width:25rem}.v2-cards img{height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.v2-banner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin:0 2vw 8rem;border-radius:70px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;overflow:hidden}.v2-banner>div{padding:7vw}.v2-banner p{font-size:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-banner h2{font:clamp(3.8rem,6vw,6.5rem)/.9 'Italiana',serif}.v2-banner h2 i{color:var(--yellow);font-weight:400}.v2-banner a{display:inline-block;padding:1rem 1.3rem;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--green);font-weight:700}.v2-banner img{height:100%;min-height:660px;object-fit:cover}
.v2-social{padding:8rem 2vw;background:var(--green);color:#fff;text-align:center}.v2-social>p{margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.7rem}.v2-social>a{display:block;margin:1rem 0 4rem;font:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem)/1 'Italiana',serif;color:var(--yellow)}.v2-social>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1rem}.v2-social img{height:32vw;max-height:500px;border-radius:35px;object-fit:cover}.v2-social img:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(2rem)}
.v2-contact{padding:10rem 5vw;background:var(--yellow);text-align:center}.v2-contact>span{font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase}.v2-contact h2{margin:2rem 0;font:clamp(6rem,15vw,14rem)/.8 'Italiana',serif;color:var(--orange)}.v2-contact>div{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3rem}.v2-contact address{font-style:normal}.v2 footer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;padding:3rem;background:var(--cream)}.v2 footer p{margin:0}.v2 footer nav{justify-self:end;display:flex;gap:1rem;font-size:.7rem}.v2-fab{display:none}
@media(max-width:760px){.v2 header{position:absolute;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:1rem}.v2 header .v2-logo{font-size:1.6rem}.v2 header nav{position:absolute;top:64px;right:1rem;left:1rem;display:none;padding:1.4rem;flex-direction:column;border-radius:22px;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--green)}.v2 header nav.open{display:flex}.v2-order{display:none}.v2 header button{display:block;padding:.65rem 1rem;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:99px;background:transparent;color:#fff}.v2-hero{display:flex;min-height:100svh;flex-direction:column;background:var(--orange)}.v2-photo{height:58svh;border-radius:0 0 70px 0}.v2-photo span{bottom:1rem;left:1rem}.v2-copy{min-height:42svh;padding:1.2rem 1rem 5.5rem}.v2-copy>p{margin:.2rem 0}.v2-copy h1{margin:.5rem 0;font-size:clamp(4.1rem,20vw,5.5rem)}.v2-copy>div>p{margin:.5rem 0;font-size:.9rem}.v2-copy>div>a{display:none}.v2-intro{display:block;padding:6rem 1rem}.v2-intro aside{margin-bottom:3rem}.v2-intro aside strong{margin-top:1rem}.v2-intro h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,14vw,4.2rem)}.v2-cards{padding:0 .6rem 5rem}.v2-cards article,.v2-cards article:nth-child(even){display:flex;min-height:auto;border-radius:36px;flex-direction:column}.v2-cards article:nth-child(even) img{order:0}.v2-cards article>div{padding:2.4rem 1.4rem}.v2-cards h2{font-size:3.8rem}.v2-cards img{height:90vw;order:0}.v2-banner{display:flex;margin:0 .6rem 5rem;border-radius:36px;flex-direction:column}.v2-banner>div{padding:3rem 1.4rem}.v2-banner h2{font-size:3.6rem}.v2-banner img{min-height:0;height:85vw}.v2-social{padding:5rem .6rem}.v2-social>a{font-size:2.8rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.v2-social>div{display:flex;gap:.6rem;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}.v2-social img{flex:0 0 75vw;height:95vw;scroll-snap-align:center}.v2-social img:nth-child(even){transform:none}.v2-contact{padding:7rem 1rem}.v2-contact h2{font-size:20vw}.v2-contact>div{gap:1rem;flex-direction:column}.v2 footer{display:flex;padding:3rem 1rem 6rem;gap:1.5rem;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.v2 footer nav{justify-self:auto}.v2-fab{position:fixed;z-index:20;right:.7rem;bottom:.7rem;left:.7rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.2rem;border-radius:99px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0004}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.v2-marquee div{animation:none}}
</style>
